% ============================================================
% booklets/shared/fa/backmatter/default.bib
% ------------------------------------------------------------
% Fallback bibliography, used ONLY when a booklet's .conf does
% not set BIB_FILE. Most booklets should ship their own
% references/paper.bib instead — this file exists so a booklet
% without citations still builds cleanly (empty bibliography
% section rather than a missing-file error).
%
% Do not add real references here. Add them to the booklet's
% own references/paper.bib and point BIB_FILE at it in its
% .conf file.
% ============================================================
